OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMeta to pay up to $18bn to settle
OL,4,Aclaims its platforms harm children
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeta will also implement a host of
OL,7,Fchanges aimed at better protecting kids
OL,8,Fonline, which the states had demanded,
OL,9,Fincluding default daily time limits and
OL,10,Fnight-time blocks.
OL,12,F"This is a major moment to clean up an
OL,13,Findustry that has been hurting our
OL,14,Fkids," California Attorney General Rob
OL,15,FBonta said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
