OL,3,ABiopic, coffee brand and dog treats
OL,4,Aamong Dolly Parton's upcoming business
OL,5,Aprojects
OL,6,
OL,7,FNot just a singer-songwriter, the
OL,8,Fbusinesswoman Dolly Parton, who died
OL,9,Fearlier this week, had a slew of
OL,10,Fprojects in the pipeline, including a
OL,11,Fbiopic, documentary, avatar show,
OL,12,Fmuseum, travel stop for truckers,
OL,13,Fcoffee brand and dog treats.
OL,15,F"Dolly worked up until the day she
OL,16,Fdied. She loved seeing her dreams come
OL,17,Fto life and loved knowing her work
OL,18,Fbrought people joy," her longtime
OL,19,Fmanager Danny Nozell told US media
OL,20,Fincluding Hollywood Reporter.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787831294
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABiopic, coffee brand and dog treats
OL,4,Aamong Dolly Parton's upcoming business
OL,5,Aprojects
OL,6,
OL,7,F"If you see unreleased music, products,
OL,8,Fbooks, experiences and campaigns
OL,9,Flaunched through official Dolly Parton
OL,10,Fchannels, you can have confidence in
OL,11,Fknowing that she placed her personal
OL,12,Fstamp on it," he added.
OL,14,FParton died peacefully in hospital in
OL,15,FNashville on 25 August after a "brief
OL,16,Fbattle with cancer", after being
OL,17,Fadmitted four days before her death
OL,18,Fwith kidney and autoimmune issues.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
